Rākṣasas fold hands addressing Rāvaṇa --- Rākṣasas ask why despair with huge army --- Rākṣasas recall Kubēra tamed despite Śiva boast --- Rākṣasas recall Yakṣas slaughtered vimāna seized --- Rākṣasas recall Maya alliance Madhu subdued --- Rākṣasas recall Nāgas Dānavas subdued winning māyās --- Rākṣasas recall Varuṇa sons and Yama conquered --- Rākṣasas recall peerless Kṣatriyas slain by Rāvaṇa --- Rākṣasas dismiss danger from mere men